  "description": "YITAMOTOR is one of America’s largest retailers of automotive running boards and vehicle accessories. We take pride in our strict quality control that ensures only the highest quality running boards and auto accessories reach our customers. Every step of our production process involves a high degree of precision to ensure our running boards feature the perfect finish for enhanced slip resistance.\nFitment\nfits for Vehicles with 2\" Trailer Hitch\nFeatures\nUNIQUE DESIGN - The brand you can trust; YITAMOTOR's 6.5\" wide towing hitch steps offer you a secure and slip-proof step for peace of mind; Product is UV and rust-resistant for long-lasting use\nPRECISE COMPATIBILITY - Compatible with 2-inch hitch receiver; Check the picture showing hitch receiver's size to confirm the one for you; Made from all-in-one heavy-duty thick tubes that offer resilient durability, corrosion protection\nEASY CLEANING & ENHANCED BEARING CAPACITY - 27\" L x 6.5\" W x 5.5\" H; Improved carrying capacity of up to 350 lbs.; Made from black aluminum alloy steel pipe and silver stainless steel tread that can be easily cleaned\nQUICK INSTALLATION - Comes with detailed installation pictures and text; Simply slide it into the receiver, then into the hook and tighten it; No drilling or cutting needed\nWORRY-FREE SERVICE: Confirm that the product is what you're looking for by referring to the picture of the truck prior to purchase; Contact us if any inquiries arise\nNote: Professional installation is highly recommended.",
